  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7FSLYtk.png\" alt=\"簡易刀劍橫幅\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-skills\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TDHaFqs.png\" alt=\"試試簡易技能\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"></a><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eOWyCv6.png\" alt=\"武器變體\" width=\"1152\" height=\"648\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iduZbq5.png\" alt=\"獨特武器\" width=\"1152\" height=\"648\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wNQ0qRk.png\" alt=\"模組支援\" width=\"1152\" height=\"648\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8N3BDbZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"152\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/H8BUkyQ.png\" alt=\"更好的戰鬥支援\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8N3BDbZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"152\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WfWziAG.png\" alt=\"Patchouli支援\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8N3BDbZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"152\"></a><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hHoFbQt.png\" alt=\"額外支援\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knaves-needs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/n4a4oE0.png\" alt=\"Knaves Needs 附加\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-more\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kZgkBV3.gif\" alt=\"Simply More 附加\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s9OPf1J.png\" alt=\"需要 Architectury 與 Cloth Config\" width=\"1152\" height=\"312\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>內建額外支援</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicmetals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mythic Metals</a>&nbsp; |&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gobber-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gobber</a>&nbsp; |&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/levelz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LevelZ</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>額外支援</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Forbidden &amp; Arcanus | Twilight Forest | The Undergarden | Blue Skies | Plus The End<br>透過 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knaves-needs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Knaves Needs</a>（由 KodoDenka 製作）</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">透過 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-more\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simply More</a>（由 Rosemary__Thyme 製作）新增 10 種以上的武器類型，以及 26 種以上的獨特武器</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">偏好另一種外觀？</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/simply-swords-classic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡易刀劍經典版（舊版 3D 模型）</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/yourscraft/files/all\" rel=\"nofollow\">Yourscraft 材質包 + 簡易刀劍附加</a>（由 Manos_Of_Fate 製作）</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/armaments-of-legend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">傳奇軍備材質包</a>（由 Count_Sjorn_Paradox 製作）</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">其他 Timefall Development 模組</h3><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-steak\" rel=\"nofollow\">金牛排</a>&nbsp;- 新增金牛排與附魔金牛排<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcdw\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 地下城武器</a>&nbsp;- 將 Minecraft 地下城的武器帶入 Minecraft<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcdar\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 地下城神器</a>&nbsp;- 將 Minecraft 地下城的神器帶入 Minecraft<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcda\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 地下城盔甲</a> - 將 Minecraft 地下城的盔甲帶入 Minecraft<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcsa\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 故事模式盔甲</a>&nbsp;- 將 Minecraft 故事模式的盔甲套裝帶入 Minecraft<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/save-gear-on-death\" rel=\"nofollow\">死亡保留裝備</a>&nbsp;- 在保留物品與掉落物品之間取得平衡<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/headshot-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">爆頭 [Forge]</a>&nbsp;- 允許玩家與部分生物被爆頭<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-summoning\" rel=\"nofollow\">生物召喚</a>&nbsp;- 召喚生物與你並肩作戰<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diamond-shards-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">鑽石碎片</a>&nbsp;- 將鑽石分解成九個碎片，非常適合以鑽石為基礎的經濟體系<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">戰利品設定</a>&nbsp;- 全面自訂 Minecraft 的戰利品表<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/interchangeable\" rel=\"nofollow\">可互換</a>&nbsp;- 一個 Minecraft 模組，可根據設定互換配方中的輸入項目</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-skills\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡易技能</a> - 一個專為 Fabric 設計的全面技能樹模組</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p>想在伺服器上和朋友一起玩簡易刀劍嗎？要不要考慮使用 BisectHosting 的伺服器？它們已經設定完成，隨時可以開始！<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fTimefall\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/9deaa8f0-11c2-41f1-8f4f-32d2493b0912.png\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/tRUdaHx7gG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\